CM Two-band trap dipole: parallel LC traps (LD 1), a series load (LD 0)
CM and a distributed resistive load (LD 2), using unit suffixes.
CE
SY inner=5.0, trap=0.1, outer=3.2, h=10
GW 1 11 0 -inner-trap-outer h 0 -inner-trap h #12
GW 2 1 0 -inner-trap h 0 -inner h #12
GW 3 21 0 -inner h 0 inner h #12
GW 4 1 0 inner h 0 inner+trap h #12
GW 5 11 0 inner+trap h 0 inner+trap+outer h #12
GE 0
LD 1 2 1 1 0 4.7uH 52pF
LD 1 4 1 1 0 4.7uH 52pF
LD 0 3 11 11 1.5 0 0
LD 2 5 1 11 2 0.1uH 0
EX 0 3 11 0 1 0
FR 0 4 0 0 7.05 7.0
EN
